I agree.  This doesn't seem like the place to innovate.

I prefer the verbose names with -- and =, which not
coincidentally matches the way it was done in 1.0.

We don't have the equivalent of data in the Stan command, or I
should say we have several kinds of data, plain old data, initialization
data, and covariance or mass matrix data.

