On second thought, I think adding prefixes is a really bad idea.  The problem is that categorical arguments can also be values, so if you want to have

adapt_mu=5 adapt_eta=8 adapt_t0=2…

you'd also have to have

--algorithm=hmc_metric=unit_e --algorithm=hmc_stepsize=0.1…

which is not fun to type in.  It'd also break the recursive encapsulation of the argument objects/methods.

Braces or a suffix'd colon would still be possible,

adapt={mu=5 eta=8 t0=2...}
--algorithm=hmc={metric=unit_e stepsize=0.1…}

Although that would require some nontrivial parsing work.

