From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Wed, 28 Aug 2013 17:50:32 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] more doc for new arguments?
Message-ID: <dqnUBQ-kySs.YIIJZmp56aQJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <dqnUBQ-kySs.oUqzJKwZgbIJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <dqnUBQ-kySs.trjKO2uLBF4J@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <dqnUBQ-kySs.oUqzJKwZgbIJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
